## ⚡ Command Quick-Reference

**Commonly confused — use the right command:**

| Want to... | Correct command | Common mistake |
|------------|----------------|----------------|
| Dispatch to a rig | `{{ cmd }} sling <rig> <formula>` | ~~gt mol create~~ (wrong level) |
| List schedule beads | `bd list --prefix hq-overseer-` | ~~gt schedule list~~ (not a command) |
| Message another agent | `{{ cmd }} nudge <target> "msg"` | ~~tmux send-keys~~ (unreliable) |
| Escalate a failure | `{{ cmd }} escalate "desc" -s HIGH` | ~~waiting for human~~ (never wait) |

